.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.TH kannadi-manpages 1  "manpages " 
.SH NAME
kannadi\-manpages \- Write the man pages to a folder
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBkannadi manpages\fR [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIDIR\fR> 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Write the man pages to a folder
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
<\fIDIR\fR>
Folder to write kannadi.1 and a page per command to
.SH EXTRA
Example:
  kannadi manpages /usr/local/share/man/man1
